<div class="sect" style="margin-top:0">THE EXCHANGE</div><div class="dim small">Player-to-player orders shared across every market in the Rift. Sell orders hold your goods in escrow, and buy orders hold your credits. Crossing orders fill at the resting price, and sellers pay a <%~ it.EXCHANGEFee %>% fee. Bought commodities wait in exchange storage, and crates go straight to your stock.</div>
    <div class="rrow"><select id="xitem"><%~ it.options %></select><select id="xside"><option value="sell">SELL</option><option value="buy">BUY</option></select><input id="xqty" type="number" min="1" value="1" style="width:70px" title="quantity"><input id="xprice" type="number" min="1" placeholder="price each" style="width:110px"><button class="btn sm" data-act="xplace">PLACE</button></div>